":"@sm_hn","author_link":"https://twitter.com/sm_hn/status/1455004659043635201","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1385485900306522115/D66XDiz2_normal.png","text":"「googleで\"zenfone8 ramdump\"と検索してください。\n色々と出てくると思います。\n結論から言うと、端末が何も出来ない状態となり、いわゆる文鎮化してしまう不具合です。\n世界中で発生しており、騒ぎが徐々に大きくなっています。」\n\u003chttps://review.kakaku.com/review/K0001375130/ReviewCD=1511886/?lid=review_twt_tweet\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1635735118,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/sm_hn/status/1455004659043635201","original_url":"https://twitter.com/sm_hn/status/1455004659043635201"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nandato","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"fuita","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2RU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"229cdb67-6ccf-4e96-ba2a-5f9775945f10","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"まあでも、CO2の貯まりやすい場所ってムラがあるので、ピンポイントにその場所を探して、そこに置いておくという手もあると思います。（例えば、作業机の近くとか）\n\n呼気が当たる場所だと使い物にならないのでそこは注意ですが....","ts":"1635739227.493400","thread_ts":"1635738489.490300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Ztk"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"0fadd523-1d28-48b5-8a73-9451e3006b24","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"やっぱり低いほうがいいでしょうか?","ts":"1635738489.490300","thread_ts":"1635738489.490300","reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JNg5x"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"8bae78e1-e7ef-4814-ab92-b9de3bd6ee53","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ぼくの自宅は3～4階+屋上への出口って構成なんですが、窓やドアを閉め切ると如実に下から濃度上がっていきます。\n\n換気はもちろん3階と屋上を開けると効率が良い。","ts":"1635738779.492300","thread_ts":"1635738588.490800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1635738794.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast